data: {"id": "907d4209a852407f-thinking-parallel_evidence-1839", "run_id": "907d4209a852407f", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "Let me analyze the evidence for `aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-7b77l` based on the collected facts.\n\n## 实体确认\n- **Pod**: `workload-5f4fb9ff45-7b77l`\n- **Namespace**: `aiops-case-09`\n- **Node**: `node2` (10.2.0.50)\n- **Pod IP**: `172.16.104.35`\n- **UID**: `13aa0496-5af5-4103-882f-2a096df0dc3f`\n- **Container**: `app`\n- **Image**: `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`\n- **Service Account**: `default`\n- **Owner**: ReplicaSet `workload-5f4fb9ff45`\n- **Service**: `workload` (`3910e6", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788810095323, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

